  "id": "vegan-bean-taco-filling",
  "name": "Vegan Bean Taco Filling",
  "subtitle": "A savory, spiced filling for tacos and wraps",
  "description": "Mashed black beans simmer with tender vegetables, cornmeal, salsa, and warm spices for a hearty taco filling.",
